# Foundry dependencies are git submodules. They are TRACKED as gitlinks and
# restored by `git clone --recursive`, or `forge install` in an existing clone.
#
# They were .gitignored in the project this is built from, which meant a fresh
# clone could not compile the contracts at all — the first thing any reader
# tries. Two thousand upstream files still stay out of the diff; the difference
# is that the commit records which version, so the build is reproducible.

# Playwright
